  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdc494b1a2f7f5546a3fed99168e8776, type: 2}
  textLine:
  - If this takes longer than a pint, I'm busy.
  - Ah, good to see a old friend. What can I get ye?
  - Joe took me tools again. I swear, I'll bury that bastard...
  - If ye brake it, you buy it. If i break it...
